No preparation, syntax-test, shared test, project-module, native, browser or integration command has been run from this folder. Built-in-only final source/baseline authorship is recorded separately. `author-inventory.json` has schema 1 and status `frozen_actual_baseline_preparation_sources_pending_independent_review`; its `files` array contains exact relative path, bytes and raw_sha256 rows for every authored/preserved file except itself. Root must independently review and verify it before a source-bound one-shot dispatch. `execution-r01/` and transaction receipts remain absent.

